honestly, what is a toxic solution without turning themselves into a human sacrifice? Now, the psychological term narcissism does get thrown around quite a bit as a sort of a catch-all term for someone who is self-involved or overconfident in themselves. You know, those people who post selfies constantly on Facebook or Instagram, What exactly is narcissism, though, and how can you recognize it in someone or even yourself? Narcissism is very much sort of the buzzword of our time, and it is woefully misunderstood. Narcissism is very much viewed as a disorder of sort of inflated self-esteem and grandiosity. It is those things, but in fact it's a disorder of self-esteem.
