make deep, intimate, connected, empathic ties with another human being. When you're with someone who's narcissistic, it can often throw you off because initially, because they're so good at putting on that admiration-seeking show, they can be charismatic, often quite smart, charming, and very gripping. But over time, all of that superficial facade is met behind with a real lack of empathy, often a lack of compassion. They often don't listen very well. They'll be prone to patterns like deceit and lying. It's not the stuff that is good for very connected relationships. And the fact is, the impacts of narcissism aren't just in the intimate relationship. We see them in any critical relationships, narcissistic parents, narcissistic children, siblings, friends,
与另一个人建立深层、亲密、紧密、有同理心的联系。当你和一个自恋者在一起时，这往往会让你感到困惑，因为起初，由于他们非常擅长展示那种寻求赞美的表演，他们可能很有魅力，通常相当聪明、迷人且非常吸引人。但随着时间的推移，所有这些肤浅的伪装背后，是真正的缺乏同理心，通常也缺乏怜悯心。他们往往不善于倾听。他们容易出现欺骗和撒谎的模式。这些对建立良好的关系并无益处。事实上，自恋的影响不仅仅存在于亲密关系中。我们在任何关键关系中都能看到它们：自恋的父母、自恋的孩子、兄弟姐妹、朋友……

