00:04:52.000 --> 00:05:26.000
coworkers, and bosses. It behaves the same in all of those situations, but more than anything, it often feels like we're not being heard, we're not being noticed, and in fact, we're often being criticized and rejected on a chronic day-after-day way. The tough thing about a relationship with a narcissist is that they often run on hope. Most people, especially in an intimate relationship, with a narcissist, these relationships run on the hope of a someday better. I always call it the Beauty and the Beast piece of this. Because what did Beauty do? She just sort of danced around and loved the beast.
同事和老板。它在所有这些情况下的表现都是一样的，但最重要的是，它往往让我们觉得没有被倾听，没有被关注，事实上，我们经常在日复一日地被批评和拒绝。与自恋者建立关系的难点在于，他们往往靠“希望”维持。大多数人，特别是在与自恋者的亲密关系中，这些关系靠着“未来会更好”的希望维持。我总是称之为“美女与野兽”的部分。因为美女做了什么？她只是跳舞并爱着野兽。

